":36,"tongjian_id":"8d628b96-db0e-11ef-9084-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8d628b97-db0e-11ef-98cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"大梁","place_note":"河南開封","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8d628b98-db0e-11ef-9f33-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁溝","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁沟","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"8d628b99-db0e-11ef-93a8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志：陳留郡浚儀縣，故大梁，狼湯水所經也。水經：渠水出滎陽北河，東南流至浚儀縣。註云：始皇使王賁攻魏，斷故渠，引水東南出以灌大梁，因謂之梁溝。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志：陈留郡浚仪县，故大梁，狼汤水所经也。水经：渠水出荥阳北河，东南流至浚仪县。注云：始皇使王贲攻魏，断故渠，引水东南出以灌大梁，因谓之梁沟。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8d628b8b-db0e-11ef-a564-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"王贲，频阳东乡（今陕西省富平县东北）人，秦代将领，通武侯，为名将王翦之子。在秦灭六国战争中，先后灭亡魏、燕、代、齐。","link_td_id":"Q10004662","link_td_number_id":326240,"people_name":"王賁","people_name_jianti_auto":"王贲","people_xingming":"王贲","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d628b9e-db0e-11ef-860a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-225,"link_td_description":"魏王假，原名魏假，魏景湣王魏增之子。","link_td_id":"Q10001811","link_td_number_id":334927,"people_name":"魏王假","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏王假","people_xingming":"魏假","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8d628ba2-db0e-11ef-9dfb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","place_note":"都大梁，河南开封","resolved_place_entity_id":1,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d628b9f-db0e-11ef-9c38-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","resolved_place_entity_id":42,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8d628ba0-db0e-11ef-b364-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"大梁","place_note":"河南開封","resolved_place_entity_id":236,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8d628ba1-db0e-11ef-bc9c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":1,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8d628ba3-db0e-11ef-a8f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"秦灭魏之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0549"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/临敌易将","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，将岂可易乎？","context_before":"...以骑劫易乐毅而败，赵以赵括易廉颇而败，以赵葱易李牧而灭，","source_end_index":109,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"da20ffe5-4b1d-4e20-ae3a-169032641b78","source_start_index":99,"source_text":"魏使人代信陵君将亦灭"}],"path":"随笔/卷十/临敌易将","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《史记》：大梁东门曰夷门，侯嬴为夷门监，即此。《括地志》...","context_before":"...曰大梁，魏惠王始都此。秦昭王三十二年，穰侯攻魏，至大梁。","source_end_index":70,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f6c61206-cb80-544b-9473-a8a5a0051f72","source_start_index":46,"source_text":"始皇三十二年，王贲攻魏，引河沟灌大梁，大梁城坏。"},{"context_after":"五代时，晋、梁夹河而争，晋虽屡胜，不敢自黎阳南渡者，梁之...","context_before":"...圮。颍、亳以东，皆受其患。《汴录》：汴之要害，莫甚于河。","source_end_index":263,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"de45371d-cde3-5bed-ba5e-3d9692a44b44","source_start_index":251,"source_text":"秦王贲既引河以灌大梁矣。"},{"context_after":"鸿沟口，在河口东百里。或谓之阴沟，或谓之莨荡渠，或谓之汴...","context_before":"...东经阳武县中牟台下，为官渡；一渠东南流至浚仪县，为鸿沟。","source_end_index":218,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"21d6fe2a-92b5-52ee-965f-ff6835154ef2","source_start_index":184,"source_text":"秦始皇使王贲伐魏，断故渠，引河东南出，以灌大梁，谓之河沟，即鸿沟也。"},{"context_after":"《水经注》：济水又东，合荥渎于此，亦兼邲之称。《左传》宣...","context_before":"...沟灌魏都之处。司马贞曰：荥泽口与汴河口通，水深可灌大梁。","source_end_index":126,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d2331d31-f614-51cd-a808-7bc4d275e430","source_start_index":100,"source_text":"始皇二十六年，王贲断故渠，引水东南灌大梁，谓之梁沟。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/◎川渎二大河上（卷一百二十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后汉初，河自荥阳决入汴[河阴，故荥阳县地]。永平十三年，...","context_before":"...河，至武陟县五十六里]。县西二十里有石门渠，即古之荥口。","source_end_index":96,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9b961837-0a90-522d-9575-c8a493418082","source_start_index":50,"source_text":"秦始皇二十三年攻魏，引河沟灌大梁。汉王横言：秦攻魏，决河灌其都，决处遂大，不可复补，即此矣。"}],"path":"川渎/◎川渎二大河上（卷一百二十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1王賁伐魏，引河溝以灌大梁。三月，城壞。魏王假降，殺之，遂滅魏。","content_fanyi":"秦将王贲率军攻打魏国，引汴河水灌淹魏国都城大梁。三月，大梁城墙毁坏。魏王假投降，被秦军杀死，魏国于是灭亡。","content_jianti_auto":"1王贲伐魏，引河沟以灌大梁。三月，城坏。魏王假降，杀之，遂灭魏。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":533,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d628b8a-db0e-11ef-9f93-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"安陵君","people_name_jianti_auto":"安陵君","people_xingming":"安陵君","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d628ba5-db0e-11ef-853a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"安陵君","people_name_jianti_auto":"安陵君","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8d628ba6-db0e-11ef-9ed9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"安陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"安陵","place_note":"河南鄢陵","resolved_place_entity_id":2108,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8d628ba7-db0e-11ef-be87-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":1,"start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8d628ba8-db0e-11ef-b0c0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"王使人謂安陵君曰：「寡人欲以五百里地易安陵。」安陵君曰：「大王加惠，以大易小，甚幸。雖然，臣受地於魏之先王，願終守之，弗敢易！」王義而許之。","content_fanyi":"秦王政派人对安陵君说：“我想用五百里土地换安陵国。”安陵君说：“大王施加恩惠，用大的换小的，我非常荣幸。虽然如此，我这小国的土地是从魏国先王那里接受的封地，我愿意终生守护它，不敢交换！”秦王嬴政赞许他信守道义，便应允了他的请求。","content_jianti_auto":"王使人谓安陵君曰：「寡人欲以五百里地易安陵。」安陵君曰：「大王加惠，以大易小，甚幸。虽然，臣受地于魏之先王，愿终守之，弗敢易！」王义而许之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":534,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d628ba4-db0e-11ef-88af-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions